  "why": {
    "扎": "In place names 扎 is zha (扎鲁特, 扎赉诺尔, 尖扎, 申扎); the readings learned from English names were split.",
    "藏": "As the name of the people and the region, 藏 is zang (西藏); the table's first reading is cang.",
    "cn:130726": "蔚县 is read Yu, not Wei.",
    "cn:150783": "扎兰屯's official English name is Zalantun, but its pinyin is Zhalantun; both find it, since the English name is searched too.",
    "cn:371722": "单 as a place name and surname is Shan.",
    "cn:410621": "浚县 is read Xun.",
    "cn:460301, cn:460302": "Wikidata files its Xisha District under 460302, which is 南沙区's code, and has no item for 460301.",
    "cn:632723": "称多 is read Chenduo.",
    "cn:650400": "吐鲁番 is Tulufan; 番 is pan only in a few names such as 番禺.",
    "cn:653129": "伽师 is read Jiashi.",
    "吐鲁番县": "吐鲁番 is Tulufan, as for 吐鲁番市."
